// shield slots, cut from eight green-screen "Set" composite sheets. Iron has no separate helm row
// - IDI_ORACOOL_HELM above already occupies that tier; only its icon was re-sourced, from the
// matching Iron Set sheet, for visual consistency with the rest of that tier.
//
// Stats are formulaic, not hand-tuned per item: each slot has an Iron-tier (mult 1.0) base
