// (1.0/1.30/1.65/2.10/2.70/3.50/4.60/6.00), value additionally by mult^1.4 to mirror vanilla's
// own steeper value curve, minMLvl/minStr scale additively per tier step. IDROP_NEVER throughout,
// same reason as every other Oracool item: joining the loot tables perturbs pack_test's
